Keep a shared alphabet as empty text.
Place "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz" into alphabet.
Keep a shared symbol as empty text.
Keep a shared found as 0.

To locate from look (a whole number).
The piece is the slice of alphabet from look to look plus 1.
If piece matches symbol, set found to look, return.
Locate from look plus 1.

The word is "abc".
The shifts is a list of 3, 5, 9.
The last is 2.
The suffix is a list of 3 zeros.
The running is 0.
The spot is last.
Repeat while spot is at least 0.
Set running to running plus item spot of shifts.
Set item spot of suffix to running.
Subtract 1 from spot.

The result is empty text.
For every spot from 0 to last.
Set symbol to the slice of word from spot to spot plus 1.
Set found to 0.
Locate from 0.
The moved is (found plus item spot of suffix) modulo 26.
The letter is the slice of alphabet from moved to moved plus 1.
Place letter into result.

Show result.
